THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS USED

This project does not redistribute any model weights or datasets. It depends
on, and downloads at runtime, the following third-party artifacts, each under
its own license:

  Qwen3-0.6B-Base, Qwen3-1.7B-Base          Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen

  Qwen3-32B-FP8, Qwen3-235B-A22B             Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen

  rasbt/math_distill                         Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/rasbt/math_distill
    Sources: HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500,
             qwedsacf/competition_math

  HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500                     MIT
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500

  EleutherAI/hendrycks_math                  MIT
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/EleutherAI/hendrycks_math

  vLLM, PyTorch, Transformers, Datasets, SymPy — various, permissive
    See each project's own LICENSE file.

data/traces.jsonl in this repository is output generated by Qwen3-32B-FP8 over
the EleutherAI/hendrycks_math training split, filtered against ground-truth
answers. It contains no model weights and no test-set content.